# Everything is stored and checked out with LF line endings, on every platform.
#
# This matters because the project is developed on Windows and deployed into a
# Linux container. Git's default on Windows is to convert to CRLF on checkout,
# and CRLF in the Dockerfile or in a shell script fails at runtime with an
# unhelpful error rather than at commit time.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, never converted or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Audio test fixtures: real encoded files, never text.
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.opus binary
